      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is something that I wanted since I first started making worlds!! VRChat needs more stuff like this in order to enhance the immersion and fidelity of sound overall. Also I really did not like the way they handled the last few audio related updates with the VRC Spatial override volumes as a sort of \"Hey you can use this for hearing people on a stage more clearly\" thing. It honestly added back more problems than it fixes for me. I get very disoriented and honestly a bit uncomfortable when someone is speaking from directly inside of my head instead of a real life scenario where yes the person speaking is louder than others, but they actually have a speaker driving that instead and it is still directional and has an impact on how the room reverberates the sound at higher volumes.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
